 or more people, and spaces, where a team or project keeps its conversation, files, and members in one place."}],["$","div","2",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500 mb-4","children":"Key terms"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"sm:flex sm:gap-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:w-48 sm:flex-shrink-0","children":"Direct message (DM)"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"A private conversation with one person, or a group DM with a few people."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"sm:flex sm:gap-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:w-48 sm:flex-shrink-0","children":"Space"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"A named place for a team or project conversation. People can be added or leave, and new members see the conversation."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"sm:flex sm:gap-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:w-48 sm:flex-shrink-0","children":"@mention"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Typing @ and a name in a message so that person gets a notification."}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"sm:flex sm:gap-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:w-48 sm:flex-shrink-0","children":"Reaction"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"An emoji you add to a message to answer without writing a new one."}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"sm:flex sm:gap-4","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:w-48 sm:flex-shrink-0","children":"Shortcuts"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Home, Mentions, and Starred at the top of Chat's left side. Mentions lists messages where someone mentioned you."}]]}]]}]]}],"$L1e"]}]]}],"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"]}]}]]}]
1a:["$","div",null,{"id":"practice-simulation","className":"mb-12 scroll-mt-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-[40px] sm:leading-[1.05]","children":"Practice Simulation"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft","children":"Practice what this lesson taught in a working copy of the app. Tasks appear under the window, just like GMetrix."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-10","style":{"width":"min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))","marginLeft":"calc((100% - min(1360px, calc(100vw - 2rem))) / 2)"},"children":[["$","$L24","gw-m8-google-chat-and-spaces-1",{"sim":{"id":"gw-m8-google-chat-and-spaces-1","app":"gmail","title":"Coordinate the lobby repaint in Google Chat","scenario":"The Riverside Commons lobby gets repainted next week. Quick questions and updates go in Google Chat instead of long email threads: a direct message to Kim, updates in the building's team space, the schedule shared in the space, and a new space for Elm Street move-ins.","fileName":"Google Chat","minutes":8,"initial":{"surface":"mail","me":{"name":"Jordan Lee","email":"jlee@parkviewpm.example","color":"#1a73e8"},"people":[{"name":"Denise Carter","email":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","color":"#188038","contact":true},{"name":"Marcus Reyes","email":"mreyes@parkviewpm.example","color":"#e8710a","contact":true},{"name":"Kim Nguyen","email":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","color":"#9334e6","contact":true},{"name":"Priya Shah","email":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","color":"#d93025","contact":true},{"name":"Andre Wallace","email":"awallace@parkviewpm.example","color":"#12858a","contact":true},{"name":"Tony Russo","email":"tony@russoplumbing.example","color":"#b06000","contact":true},{"name":"Grace Holloway","email":"gholloway@harborviewholdings.example","contact":true},{"name":"Darnell Brooks","email":"dbrooks@example.com","contact":true},{"name":"Rosa Delgado","email":"rdelgado@example.com"},{"name":"Tina Okafor","email":"tokafor@example.com","contact":true},{"name":"Sam Whitfield","email":"swhitfield@example.com","contact":true},{"name":"Bright Clean Services","email":"office@brightclean.example","contact":true},{"name":"City Water Utility","email":"billing@citywater.example"},{"name":"Office Supply Depot","email":"deals@officesupplydepot.example"},{"name":"Neighborly","email":"notifications@neighborly.example"},{"name":"Parkview IT Support","email":"it-support@parkview-pm-help.example"},{"name":"Rewards Center","email":"winner@claim-rewards-now.example"},{"name":"Landlord Learning Hub","email":"news@landlordlearninghub.example"}],"org":{"name":"Parkview Property Management","domain":"parkviewpm.example"},"messages":[{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m1","from":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","subject":"Welcome aboard, Jordan!","date":"2026-10-21T08:05","starred":false,"unread":true,"important":true,"body":"Hi Jordan,\n\nWelcome to Parkview Property Management! Your first week is about learning our tools. Most of our work happens in Gmail, Calendar, Drive and Meet.\n\nPlease keep an eye on the shared Maintenance and Leasing threads, and ask me anything.\n\nDenise Carter\nOffice Manager"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example","dcarter@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m2","from":"awallace@parkviewpm.example","cc":["knguyen@parkviewpm.example"],"subject":"Showing at Elm Street Apartments moved to Thursday","date":"2026-10-21T09:12","unread":true,"body":"Hi all,\n\nThe prospective tenant for Elm Street Apartments, Unit 2B asked to move Wednesday's showing to Thursday at 4:00 PM. Kim, can someone unlock the side door before then?\n\nThanks,\nAndre"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m3","from":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","subject":"October rent roll","date":"2026-10-20T16:40","body":"Hi Jordan,\n\nAttached is the October rent roll. Please don't forward it outside the office: it lists every tenant's balance.\n\nPriya","attachments":[{"name":"Rent Roll - October.xlsx","size":"48 KB"}]},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m4","from":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","subject":"Pest control visit, Riverside Commons","date":"2026-10-20T11:03","body":"FYI, the pest control company will spray the basement at Riverside Commons next Tuesday morning. No action needed from the office.\n\nKim"},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m5","from":"deals@officesupplydepot.example","subject":"30% off printer paper this week","date":"2026-10-21T06:30","category":"Promotions","unread":true,"unsubscribe":true,"body":"Stock up and save: 30% off copy paper, toner and file folders through Sunday."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m6","from":"notifications@neighborly.example","subject":"3 neighbors posted near Elm Street","date":"2026-10-20T19:22","category":"Social","unread":true,"body":"See what your neighbors are saying: a lost cat, a yard sale and a question about recycling day."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m7","from":"billing@citywater.example","subject":"Your October statement is ready","date":"2026-10-19T07:15","category":"Updates","body":"Your October water statement for account 55-1208 (Riverside Commons) is ready to view. Amount due: $412.60."},{"to":["jlee@parkviewpm.example"],"box":"inbox","id":"m8","from":"tony@russoplumbing.example","subject":"Invoice #4471 for Elm Street Apartments","date":"2026-10-19T14:50","body":"Hello,\n\nPlease find attached invoice #4471 for the kitchen sink repair at Elm Street Apartments, Unit 2B, completed October 16.\n\nTony Russo\nRusso Plumbing","attachments":[{"name":"Invoice 4471.pdf","size":"212 KB"}]}],"labels":[],"settings":{"categories":["Primary","Promotions","Social","Updates"]},"view":{"folder":"inbox","tab":"Primary"},"spaces":[{"id":"s-team","name":"Riverside Commons Team","kind":"space","members":["dcarter@parkviewpm.example","mreyes@parkviewpm.example","knguyen@parkviewpm.example"],"messages":[{"from":"dcarter@parkviewpm.example","text":"Reminder: the lobby repaint at Riverside Commons starts Monday. Tenants should use the side door that week.","time":"9:15 AM"},{"from":"knguyen@parkviewpm.example","text":"I'll put signs on both doors Friday afternoon.","time":"9:21 AM"}]},{"id":"s-priya","name":"Priya Shah","kind":"dm","members":["pshah@parkviewpm.example"],"messages":[{"from":"pshah@parkviewpm.example","text":"Thanks for sending the October rent roll!","time":"Yesterday"}]}],"drive":[{"name":"Lobby Repaint Schedule","kind":"sheet","sharedWith":["dcarter@parkviewpm.example"]},{"name":"Lobby Repaint Plan","kind":"doc","sharedWith":["dcarter@parkviewpm.example"]},{"name":"Tenant Handbook","kind":"doc","sharedWith":["dcarter@parkviewpm.example","mreyes@parkviewpm.example","knguyen@parkviewpm.example","awallace@parkviewpm.example","pshah@parkviewpm.example"]}]},"tasks":[{"instruction":"Open Google Chat from Gmail.","hint":"On the far left of Gmail, select Chat.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"app","value":"chat"}}]},{"instruction":"Start a direct message with Kim Nguyen.","hint":"Select New chat (top left). Type Kim, pick Kim Nguyen, then select Start chat.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"newdm","value":"People: knguyen@parkviewpm.example"}}]},{"instruction":"Send Kim: “Can you check the lobby lights at Riverside Commons today?”","hint":"Type in the message box at the bottom and press Enter (or select Send message).","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"chat:dm1","value":"Can you check the lobby lights at Riverside Commons today?","match":"includes"},"alt":[{"kind":"type","target":"chat:dm1","value":["lobby lights","Riverside Commons"],"match":"all"}]}]},{"instruction":"Open the Riverside Commons Team space and react to Denise's reminder with a thumbs up.","hint":"Under Spaces, select Riverside Commons Team. Point to Denise's message, select Add reaction (smiley face), and choose 👍 Thumbs up.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"command","id":"chat.react","value":"s-team:0|👍"}}]},{"instruction":"Andre Wallace isn't in the space yet. Post “@Andre Wallace the lobby repaint starts Monday. Please bring prospects in through the side door.” and add him to the space when Chat asks.","hint":"In the message box, type @And and pick Andre Wallace from the list, then type the rest and press Enter. In the box that opens, select Add member and send.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"chat:s-team","value":"Message: @Andre Wallace the lobby repaint starts Monday. Please bring prospects in through the side door.\nAdd member: awallace@parkviewpm.example","match":"includes"},"alt":[{"kind":"type","target":"chat:s-team","value":["Message: @Andre Wallace","side door","Add member: awallace@parkviewpm.example"],"match":"all"}]}]},{"instruction":"Share the Drive file Lobby Repaint Schedule in the space with the message “Here's the repaint schedule.” Give the space members Viewer access.","hint":"Type Here's the repaint schedule. then @Lobby and pick Lobby Repaint Schedule under Files. Press Enter. Chat asks you to select the type of access: choose the one that lets members view the file but not comment or edit (Viewer), then select Send.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"chat:s-team","value":"Message: Here's the repaint schedule.\nFile: Lobby Repaint Schedule\nFile access: Viewer","match":"includes"},"alt":[{"kind":"type","target":"chat:s-team","value":["File: Lobby Repaint Schedule","File access: Viewer"],"match":"all"}]}]},{"instruction":"Create a new space named “Elm Street Move-Ins”.","hint":"Select New chat › Create a space. Type the name and select Create.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"newspace","value":"Space name: Elm Street Move-Ins"}}]},{"instruction":"Add Andre Wallace and Priya Shah to the new space.","hint":"In the space, select Add people. Type Andre and pick him, type Priya and pick her, then select Add.","steps":[{"action":{"kind":"type","target":"addpeople:sp2","value":"People: awallace@parkviewpm.example; pshah@parkviewpm.example","match":"includes"},"alt":[{"kind":"type","target":"addpeople:sp2","value":["awallace@parkviewpm.example","pshah@parkviewpm.example"],"match":"all"}]}]}]}}]]}]]}]
